{"id":"764d83d6de54f0e72df998844c332f83728b9f7f","axis":"silent","repo":"TYPO3/typo3","sha":"764d83d6de54f0e72df998844c332f83728b9f7f","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"typo3/sysext/core/Documentation/Changelog/15.0/Feature-89760-FilterTheFormListByStorageLocation.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,39 @@","+..  include:: /Includes.rst.txt","+","+..  _feature-89760-1791560506:","+","+==========================================================","+Feature: #89760 - Filter the form list by storage location","+==========================================================","+","+See :issue:`89760`","+","+Description","+===========","+","+The form list in the :guilabel:`Forms` backend module can now be filtered by","+the location the forms are stored in. A :guilabel:`Location` select box is","+shown next to the search field as soon as forms exist in at least two","+locations.","+","+Forms stored in extensions are grouped by the path configured in","+:yaml:`persistenceManager.allowedExtensionPaths` they are stored in, for","+example :file:`EXT:my_sitepackage/Resources/Private/Forms/`. All forms stored","+in the database are one location.","+","+The filter is applied together with the search term when the","+:guilabel:`Filter` button is clicked, and :guilabel:`Reset filter` shows all","+forms again. The selected location is kept when paginating, sorting the list","+and creating a shortcut to the module.","+","+The :guilabel:`Location` column of the list shows the same location that is","+used by the filter, instead of the full path of the form definition file.","+","+Impact","+======","+","+Editors and integrators can narrow down the form list to the forms of a single","+configured extension path or to the forms stored in the database, which makes","+forms easier to find in installations with many form definitions.","+","+..  index:: Backend, ext:form"],"additions":39,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/form/Classes/Controller/FormManagerController.php","lines":["@@ -41,6 +41,7 @@"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Mvc\\Controller\\ActionController;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Extbase\\Mvc\\View\\JsonView;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Form\\Domain\\DTO\\FormConfiguration\\FormManagerConfiguration;","+use TYPO3\\CMS\\Form\\Domain\\DTO\\FormMetadata;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Form\\Domain\\DTO\\SearchCriteria;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Form\\Domain\\Repository\\FormDefinitionRepository;"," use TYPO3\\CMS\\Form\\Event\\BeforeFormIsCreatedEvent;","@@ -84,22 +85,42 @@ public function __construct(","     /**","      * Display the Form Manager. The main showing available forms.","      */","-    protected function indexAction(int $page = 1, string $searchTerm = '', string $orderField = '', ?string $orderDirection = null): ResponseInterface","+    protected function indexAction(int $page = 1, string $searchTerm = '', string $orderField = '', ?string $orderDirection = null, string $storageFilter = ''): ResponseInterface","     {","+        if ($this->request->getMethod() === 'POST') {","+            return $this->redirect('index', null, null, array_filter([","+                'searchTerm' => trim($searchTerm),","+                'storageFilter' => $storageFilter,","+                'orderField' => $orderField,","+                'orderDirection' => (string)$orderDirection,","+            ], static fn(string $value): bool => $value !== ''));","+        }","         $formSettings = $this->getFormSettings();","         $formManagerConfiguration = FormManagerConfiguration::fromArray($formSettings['formManager']);","         $hasForms = $this->formPersistenceManager->hasForms([]);","         $searchCriteria = new SearchCriteria(searchTerm: trim($searchTerm), orderField: $orderField, orderDirection: $orderDirection);","         $returnUrl = $this->request->getAttribute('normalizedParams')->getRequestUri();","         $forms = $hasForms ? $this->getAvailableFormDefinitions($formSettings, $searchCriteria, $returnUrl) : [];","+        $storageFilterOptions = [];","+        if ($hasForms) {","+            $storageFilterOptions = $this->getStorageFilterOptions(","+                $searchCriteria->searchTerm === '' ? $forms : $this->formPersistenceManager->listForms($formSettings, new SearchCriteria())","+            );","+        }","+        if (count($storageFilterOptions) < 2 || !isset($storageFilterOptions[$storageFilter])) {","+            $storageFilter = '';","+        }","+        $forms = $this->filterFormsByStorage($forms, $storageFilter);","         $arrayPaginator = new ArrayPaginator($forms, $page, self::PAGINATION_MAX);","         $pagination = new SimplePagination($arrayPaginator);","-        $moduleTemplate = $this->initializeModuleTemplate($this->request, $page, $searchTerm);","+        $moduleTemplate = $this->initializeModuleTemplate($this->request, $page, $searchTerm, $storageFilter);","         $formManagerAppInitialData = $this->getFormManagerAppInitialData($formManagerConfiguration);","         $moduleTemplate->assignMultiple([","             'paginator' => $arrayPaginator,","             'pagination' => $pagination,","             'searchTerm' => $searchTerm,","+            'storageFilter' => $storageFilter,","+            'storageFilterOptions' => count($storageFilterOptions) > 1 ? $storageFilterOptions : [],","             'orderField' => $searchCriteria->orderField,","             'orderDirection' => $searchCriteria->orderDirection,","             'hasForms' => $hasForms,","@@ -427,6 +448,40 @@ protected function valueContainsSearchTerm(string $value, string $searchTerm): b","         return str_contains(strtolower($value), strtolower($searchTerm));","     }"," ","+    /**","+     * Returns the storage locations the given forms are stored in,","+     * as filter value => label, sorted by label.","+     *","+     * @param FormMetadata[] $forms","+     * @return array<string, string>","+     */","+    protected function getStorageFilterOptions(array $forms): array","+    {","+        $options = [];","+        foreach ($forms as $formMetadata) {","+            if ($formMetadata->storageLocation !== null) {","+                $options[$formMetadata->storageLocation->identifier] = $formMetadata->storageLocation->label;","+            }","+        }","+        uasort($options, strnatcasecmp(...));","+        return $options;","+    }","+","+    /**","+     * @param FormMetadata[] $forms","+     * @return FormMetadata[]","+     */","+    protected function filterFormsByStorage(array $forms, string $storageFilter): array","+    {","+        if ($storageFilter === '') {","+            return $forms;","+        }","+        return array_values(array_filter(","+            $forms,","+            static fn(FormMetadata $formMetadata): bool => $formMetadata->storageLocation?->identifier === $storageFilter","+        ));","+    }","+","     /**","      * Returns an array with information about the references for a","      * formDefinition identified by $persistenceIdentifier.","@@ -509,7 +564,7 @@ protected function getRecordActions(string $persistenceIdentifier): array","     /**","      * Init ModuleTemplate and register document header buttons","      */","-    protected function initializeModuleTemplate(ServerRequestInterface $request, int $page, string $searchTerm): ModuleTemplate","+    protected function initializeModuleTemplate(ServerRequestInterface $request, int $page, string $searchTerm, string $storageFilter = ''): ModuleTemplate","     {","         $moduleTemplate = $this->moduleTemplateFactory->create($request);","         // Create new","@@ -526,6 +581,10 @@ protected function initializeModuleTemplate(ServerRequestInterface $request, int","             $arguments['tx_form_web_formformbuilder']['searchTerm'] = $searchTerm;","             $arguments['tx_form_web_formformbuilder']['controller'] = 'FormManager';","         }","+        if ($storageFilter !== '') {","+            $arguments['tx_form_web_formformbuilder']['storageFilter'] = $storageFilter;","+            $arguments['tx_form_web