t least two locations, a","+:guilabel:`Location` select box is shown next to the search field. Each","+path configured in","+:ref:`allowedExtensionPaths <persistencemanager.allowedExtensionPaths>`","+that contains forms is one location, and all forms stored in the database","+are one location. Click :guilabel:`Filter` to apply the search term and","+the location, and :guilabel:`Reset filter` to show all forms again. The","+selected location is kept when paginating and sorting the list.","+"," Creation and duplication of forms is made easier by a ``form wizard``."," The wizard guides the editor through form creation and offers a"," variety of settings, such as the storage, the prototype, and start"],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"typo3/sysext/form/Resources/Private/Language/Database.xlf","lines":["@@ -201,6 +201,15 @@","       <trans-unit id=\"formManager.location\">","         <source>Location</source>","       </trans-unit>","+      <trans-unit id=\"formManager.storage_filter.all\">","+        <source>All locations</source>","+      </trans-unit>","+      <trans-unit id=\"formManager.filter.submit\">","+        <source>Filter</source>","+      </trans-unit>","+      <trans-unit id=\"formManager.filter.reset\">","+        <source>Reset filter</source>","+      </trans-unit>","       <trans-unit id=\"formManager.references\">","         <source>References</source>","       </trans-unit>","@@ -222,12 +231,18 @@","       <trans-unit id=\"formManager.forms_not_found.message\">","         <source>Once created, forms will be displayed here.</source>","       </trans-unit>","-      <trans-unit id=\"formManager.forms_not_found_by_search_term.message\">","+      <trans-unit id=\"formManager.forms_not_found_by_search_term.message\" x-unused-since=\"15.0\">","         <source>There are currently no forms found containing the search term \"%1s\".</source>","       </trans-unit>","-      <trans-unit id=\"formManager.remove_search_term\">","+      <trans